WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:16.827
Zann smiled at the girl from school.

2
00:00:16.847 --> 00:00:20.129
"Thanks for getting rid of that reporter," he said.

3
00:00:20.149 --> 00:00:21.149
"I'm Zann."

4
00:00:21.169 --> 00:00:22.470
"I know."

5
00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:23.290
She smiled.

6
00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:26.252
"Everyone at the Academy knows who you are.

7
00:00:26.772 --> 00:00:27.332
I'm Mari."

8
00:00:27.353 --> 00:00:29.294
"Nice to meet you.

9
00:00:29.754 --> 00:00:30.734
Do you live around here?"

10
00:00:31.034 --> 00:00:31.615
Zann asked.

11
00:00:32.675 --> 00:00:33.576
Mari shook her head.

12
00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:34.901
"I live in Treeview."

13
00:00:35.921 --> 00:00:39.083
Treeview was a wealthy neighborhood on the southern edge of the city.

14
00:00:39.103 --> 00:00:41.124
"Do you live near here?"

15
00:00:41.444 --> 00:00:42.105
Mari asked.

16
00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:44.966
"No. But my parents' lab is right there."

17
00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:48.008
Zann pointed across the street.

18
00:00:49.089 --> 00:00:50.590
Mari's eyes widened.

19
00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:52.051
"I've heard about them!

20
00:00:53.311 --> 00:00:58.074
Are they really working with all the ancient magical relics Morb found in the Cave of the Unknown?"

21
00:00:59.335 --> 00:01:00.495
She sounded impressed.

22
00:01:01.448 --> 00:01:04.570
"Like the Dragontamer's Charm, and the Mask of Zanta?

23
00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:06.391
That must be fascinating!"

24
00:01:06.411 --> 00:01:09.492
"Yeah." Zann shrugged.

25
00:01:09.512 --> 00:01:11.894
"Do you want to come in and meet them?"

26
00:01:11.914 --> 00:01:14.295
"Yes!" Mari exclaimed.

27
00:01:14.315 --> 00:01:17.337
"I'm super interested in that kind of work.

28
00:01:17.717 --> 00:01:19.378
I want to be a researcher someday."

29
00:01:20.438 --> 00:01:22.599
Zann felt another pang of homesickness.

30
00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:25.621
Perda was interested in research too.

31
00:01:27.682 --> 00:01:31.004
She was always investigating other worlds and new forms of magic.

32
00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:34.222
He led Mari into the lab, with Zing following.

33
00:01:39.846 --> 00:01:42.928
His parents were both bent over their work when Zann entered.

34
00:01:44.028 --> 00:01:46.250
Zann felt happy every time he saw them.

35
00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:52.214
They'd been lost in the vortex for four years, and he still could hardly believe they were really

36
00:01:52.314 --> 00:01:54.355
back. "Zann!"

37
00:01:54.695 --> 00:01:56.537
His mother, Asta, spotted him first.

38
00:01:56.557 --> 00:01:58.278
"How was school today?"

39
00:01:58.298 --> 00:02:01.540
"Fine." Zann waved toward Mari.

40
00:02:02.592 --> 00:02:03.332
"This is Mari.

41
00:02:03.673 --> 00:02:04.993
She goes to the Academy too."

42
00:02:05.013 --> 00:02:06.674
"Hello, Mari."

43
00:02:07.114 --> 00:02:09.835
Nax, Zann's father, strode over to shake hands.

44
00:02:09.855 --> 00:02:12.756
"Any friend of Zann's is a friend of ours."

45
00:02:12.776 --> 00:02:16.318
"It's an honor to meet you both," Mari said.

46
00:02:16.338 --> 00:02:18.619
"I've heard a lot about your work."

47
00:02:19.719 --> 00:02:21.000
"It keeps us busy."

48
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.041
Zann's mother chuckled.

49
00:02:23.061 --> 00:02:25.002
"Would you like a tour of the lab?"

50
00:02:25.022 --> 00:02:26.723
"I'd love it!"

51
00:02:26.983 --> 00:02:29.624
Mari eagerly followed Asta into the next room.

52
00:02:30.736 --> 00:02:32.658
Zann stuck his hand in his pocket.

53
00:02:32.678 --> 00:02:34.679
"What do you have there, son?"

54
00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:35.760
his father asked.

55
00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:38.863
"A message moth from my friends back home."

56
00:02:39.964 --> 00:02:41.905
Zann shot his father a sheepish look.

57
00:02:42.706 --> 00:02:44.367
"I mean, from Swamp Bottom."

58
00:02:45.388 --> 00:02:46.769
His father patted his shoulder.

59
00:02:46.789 --> 00:02:48.711
"It's okay, Zann.

60
00:02:48.991 --> 00:02:50.732
You lived there for over four years.

61
00:02:51.673 --> 00:02:52.674
I'm sure you miss it."

62
00:02:53.795 --> 00:02:55.596
"Only a little," Zann said quickly.

63
00:02:55.616 --> 00:02:57.998
"It's a pretty boring place.

64
00:02:58.639 --> 00:02:59.820
But I do miss my friends."

65
00:03:00.768 --> 00:03:03.549
He pulled out the moth and scanned the message on its wing.

66
00:03:03.569 --> 00:03:05.509
"Are they coming to the party?"

67
00:03:05.809 --> 00:03:06.550
his father asked.

68
00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:09.450
Zann's birthday was in a couple of weeks.

69
00:03:10.071 --> 00:03:15.092
His parents had suggested a party to celebrate, and Zann had invited the gang from Swamp Bottom.

70
00:03:15.112 --> 00:03:17.192
"They're not sure yet."

71
00:03:17.633 --> 00:03:21.234
Zann sighed and released the moth, which flew out the window.

72
00:03:21.254 --> 00:03:25.275
"Gliss' parents don't want her to ride a dragon this far.

73
00:03:26.295 --> 00:03:29.616
And they're not sure if they'll be able to take time off to zap her and the others

74
00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:32.225
here." "Hmm."

75
00:03:32.245 --> 00:03:33.586
Nax scratched his chin.

76
00:03:33.606 --> 00:03:36.749
"Well, maybe they'll work something out."

77
00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:38.651
Zann hoped so.

78
00:03:39.792 --> 00:03:45.257
First City was far from Swamp Bottom—much too far for his friends to zap here on their own.

79
00:03:46.337 --> 00:03:49.260
Before Zann could say anything else, Mari rushed back in.

80
00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:52.483
"I just saw the Mask of Zanta!"

81
00:03:52.743 --> 00:03:54.404
she cried, her eyes sparkling.

82
00:03:54.424 --> 00:03:58.248
"This is the most incredible day of my life!"

83
00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:01.601
Asta followed her, smiling.

84
00:04:01.622 --> 00:04:06.386
"Mari volunteered to help us catalog the relics," she told her husband.

85
00:04:06.406 --> 00:04:08.427
"I'd love to help!"

86
00:04:08.687 --> 00:04:09.228
Mari said.

87
00:04:09.248 --> 00:04:12.371
"The teachers at school say I'm very precise.

88
00:04:12.971 --> 00:04:14.893
I promise I won't make any mistakes."

89
00:04:15.653 --> 00:04:17.875
"That's very nice of you," Nax told her.

90
00:04:17.895 --> 00:04:20.117
"We might take you up on that, Mari."

91
00:04:20.998 --> 00:04:25.281
Clunk! Everyone jumped as a device crashed to the floor.

92
00:04:26.282 --> 00:04:28.084
It had a dial and a small hose.

93
00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:31.861
Zing quickly snatched the device up in his mouth.

94
00:04:31.881 --> 00:04:35.962
"Zing!" Asta grabbed the device from the dragon.

95
00:04:35.982 --> 00:04:38.283
"You naughty beast."

96
00:04:39.503 --> 00:04:40.703
"What is that thing?"

97
00:04:41.063 --> 00:04:41.704
Zann asked.

98
00:04:41.724 --> 00:04:44.344
"It's called an infusinator."

99
00:04:45.164 --> 00:04:47.125
His mother set the device back on the shelf.

100
00:04:47.145 --> 00:04:50.266
"It's a new invention we're working on."

101
00:04:51.226 --> 00:04:52.526
She shook a finger at Zing.

102
00:04:52.546 --> 00:04:54.387
"And it's not edible!"

103
00:04:54.407 --> 00:04:57.768
"You have so many interesting things here."

104
00:04:59.196 --> 00:05:00.717
Mari peered at another item.

105
00:05:00.737 --> 00:05:01.557
"What's this?"

106
00:05:01.577 --> 00:05:03.839
"The guidelink?

107
00:05:04.379 --> 00:05:07.060
Zann's father invented that one," Asta said.

108
00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:11.563
"We think it might allow people to navigate the vortex more easily."

109
00:05:12.563 --> 00:05:13.284
Nax grinned.

110
00:05:13.304 --> 00:05:15.805
"Yes, but don't get too excited yet.

111
00:05:16.606 --> 00:05:18.307
We're still working out the kinks."

112
00:05:19.247 --> 00:05:19.988
"What does it do?"

113
00:05:20.308 --> 00:05:24.870
Zann asked, thinking back to how difficult it had been to travel through the vortex.

114
00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:27.952
"It does several things," Nax said.

115
00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:32.884
"So far it seems best at locating and locking onto sources of magic power."

116
00:05:32.904 --> 00:05:39.669
"That way, travelers can recover their magical energy faster," Asta said.

117
00:05:39.689 --> 00:05:43.953
"It also helps them avoid worlds with weak or no magic."

118
00:05:45.074 --> 00:05:49.857
Zann shuddered, remembering the time he and his friends had almost been trapped on a world with no

119
00:05:49.938 --> 00:05:53.540
magic. "That's amazing," Mari said.

120
00:05:54.501 --> 00:05:57.584
But this time she sounded a little nervous as well as impressed.

121
00:05:58.588 --> 00:05:59.849
Zann wasn't surprised.

122
00:06:00.869 --> 00:06:06.071
Most people had never even seen a wormhole up close, let alone traveled through the vortex.

123
00:06:06.091 --> 00:06:09.753
"The vortex isn't that scary," he told her.

124
00:06:09.773 --> 00:06:11.874
"It's actually pretty cool.

125
00:06:12.274 --> 00:06:18.257
We visited this one world where—" He stopped as another message moth fluttered in and flew over to

126
00:06:18.297 --> 00:06:21.478
Mari. "Oh," she said, scanning the wing.

127
00:06:21.498 --> 00:06:25.760
"Sorry, I have to get home to watch my little cousins.

128
00:06:27.252 --> 00:06:28.613
Thank you for showing me the lab."

129
00:06:29.013 --> 00:06:30.754
She smiled at Zann and his parents.

130
00:06:30.774 --> 00:06:33.015
"See you at school, Zann."

131
00:06:36.998 --> 00:06:39.199
As soon as she was gone, Nax grinned.

132
00:06:39.219 --> 00:06:41.860
"I'm glad you're making friends, Zann.

133
00:06:42.401 --> 00:06:44.822
Especially with such a smart and pretty girl!"

134
00:06:45.962 --> 00:06:47.203
Asta was grinning too.

135
00:06:48.264 --> 00:06:49.124
Zann scowled.

136
00:06:49.144 --> 00:06:52.606
"Very funny, Dad," he muttered.

137
00:06:52.626 --> 00:06:55.568
"I'm taking Zing to the park for a while."

138
00:06:56.732 --> 00:07:01.140
He grabbed the dragon and zapped away before his parents could tease him anymore.
